All three maps are populated for every path (collision or not), before any of that path's own writes. `primary_ecosystems` records each path's actual primary ecosystem (`list[0].0`, the same value `ecosystem_primary_priority`'s sort already selected) -- this is required so later tasks (T05) never have to guess a promoted id's ecosystem from an arbitrary claiming-set member.

